        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: рассада",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "рассада (rassáda) — \"seedlings\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Весной на подоконнике стоит рассада помидоров. Vesnóy na podokónnike stoít rassáda pomidórov. In spring there are tomato seedlings on the windowsill."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, a collective noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "рассада (rassáda) is built on рассадить 'to plant out', from садить 'to plant'; EtymDB lists рассада (rassáda) without a source."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
